{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411040","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1341104001:1":{"text":"이 책에는 신의 시대에 사용했던 신성 문자로 적힌 오래된 주문이 있습니다. 하지만 몇 글자는 해독할 수가 없네요.","source_cn":"这本书里记录了一些古老的咒语，使用了诸神时代的圣书文字...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE174077FBB399AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341104002:1":{"text":"혹시 이 신성 문자를 아시는 분 계실까요?","source_cn":"不知道你们是否认识这些圣书文字呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCE135293C85475C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341104003:1":{"text":"어디 보자... 이 눈처럼 생긴 문자는 \"굽어보다\"라는 뜻이에요. 지팡이와 왕관, 비틀린 기호를 합치면 \"왕의 전사\"라는 뜻이 되고요.","source_cn":"我看看……这个像眼睛一样的文字意思是“俯视”；权杖、头...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A843A4F4705B56F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341104004:1":{"text":"그럼 이 마름모와 선이 합쳐진 기호는 뭘까요?","source_cn":"那这个菱形和线条组合起来的符号呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB47BE59EA39BD2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341104005:1":{"text":"...그건 페이지 구분선이에요!","source_cn":"……这是分页符！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA422742F5F37DC01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"팔라모르","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}